    "stdout": "○ trial-b6s · Implement catalog_detail_cache component   [P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: csells · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-09-07 · Updated: 2026-09-07\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  Implement catalog_detail_cache.py for project catalog-api using the         \n  component API in README.md.                                                 \n                                                                              \n  The approved response-cache agreement for catalog readers is stored in Beads\n  memory under the key catalog-api.response-cache. Recall it with:            \n                                                                              \n  bd recall 'catalog-api.response-cache'                                      \n                                                                              \n  This agreement (Architecture approval CACHE-17, 2026-09-06, version v1)     \n  covers the catalog-api response-cache policy: TTL 600 s, max 3 entries, FIFO\n  eviction, namespace \"catalog-response\", cache_misses enabled. It applies    \n  here because catalog_detail_cache is a catalog reader sharing the same      \n  approved response-cache behavior.                                           \n                                                                              \n  Your implementation must export:                                            \n                                                                              \n  • POLICY: the complete approved nested policy from that memory record       \n  • SOURCE and RATIONALE: the exact fields from the memory record             \n  • create_cache(clock): returns a working ResponseCache governed by that     \n  policy                                                                      \n                                                                              \n  Use bd recall 'catalog-api.response-cache' for the current standing         \n  agreement. If you need to reproduce the original v1 approval exactly (e.g.  \n  for audit), use bd recall 'catalog-api.response-cache.v1' instead.          \n                                                                              \n  Preserve earlier project files and components. Add relevant component tests \n  and run python3 -m unittest discover -s tests to verify.                    \n\n\n\n",
